{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-core":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-core/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/tbl-body-asymptotics-catalog-table1-data","@type":["folio-assistant-core:Table","doco:Table"],"label":"tbl:body-asymptotics-catalog-table1-data","kind":"table","title":"Table 1 from rem:body-asymptotics-catalog","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/rem-body-asymptotics-catalog"],"tags":["extracted-table"],"text":"body-asymptotics-catalog-table1-data.md","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"tbl:body-asymptotics-catalog-table1-data\"></a><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Body block</th>\n<th>Bound (as written)</th>\n<th><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\ordw</code>-form</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"#prop:hecke-convergence-bound\" data-at=\"mass-theory/hoefsmit-convergence-construction\">Hecke convergence bound</a></td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathrm{MAE}(k) \\leq C \\cdot r^{-(k-3)}</code>, <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">r \\approx 4</code></td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\ordw\\bigl(\\mathrm{MAE}(k)\\bigr) = -(k-3)\\,\\ordw(r)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"#conj:hoefsmit-scattering-pipeline\" data-at=\"mass-theory/transfer-matrix-mass\">Hoefsmit scattering pipeline</a></td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathrm{MAE}(k) \\leq C_0 [2]_q^{-2(k-3)}</code></td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\ordw\\bigl(\\mathrm{MAE}(k)\\bigr) = -2(k-3)\\,\\ordw([2]_q)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"#prop:jet-tower-convergence\" data-at=\"mass-theory/mass-geometric-face\">Jet-tower convergence</a></td>\n<td>tail <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\leq \\Delta_{\\max} \\cdot \\dfrac{\\hbar_q^{2(N+1)}}{1 - \\hbar_q^2}</code></td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\ordw(\\text{tail}) = 2(N+1)\\,\\ordw(\\hbar_q)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"#prop:universal-braid-branching\" data-at=\"mass-theory/hoefsmit-convergence-construction\">Universal braid branching</a></td>\n<td>per-level Plancherel weight <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">O([2]_q^{-2})</code></td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\ordw(\\text{per-level weight}) = -2\\,\\ordw([2]_q)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"#prop:unified-iterative-correction\" data-at=\"mass-theory/substrate-binding-setup\">Unified iterative correction</a></td>\n<td>Féray–Méliot <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">O(1/\\sqrt{A})</code></td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\ordw\\bigl(\\text{accumulator}\\bigr) = -\\tfrac{1}{2}\\,\\ordw(A)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"#prf:mobius-energy\" data-at=\"climax-volume-mass/mobius-energy\">Möbius energy proof</a></td>\n<td>regularised <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\int_{S^1 \\times S^1} d\\ell(x)\\,d\\ell(y)/\\vert x-y\\vert ^2</code> (Lebesgue on <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">S^1</code>)</td>\n<td>surreal Loeb-measure replacement per <a href=\"#rem:calculus-up-to-epsilon\">calculus up to <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\varepsilon</code></a> §5; <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\ordw(\\text{regulariser}) = \\ordw(\\varepsilon)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"#rem:mass-endomorphism-jet-tower\" data-at=\"mass-theory/transfer-matrix-mass\">Mass-endomorphism jet tower</a></td>\n<td>open: uniform boundedness <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\lvert \\Delta^{(n)} \\rvert \\leq \\Delta_{\\max}</code></td>\n<td><a href=\"#def:surreal-blowup-calculus\" data-at=\"appendix-surreals/conway-normal-form\">surreal blow-up calculus</a> at each jet level; <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\ordw(\\Delta^{(n)}) \\geq 0</code> conjectured</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/appendix-surreals/body-asymptotics-catalog-table1-data.md","heading":"Table","page":"b/tbl-body-asymptotics-catalog-table1-data","qa":{"counts":{"pass":43,"fail":0,"warn":0,"na":15,"unknown":0,"stale":0}}}
